Date: Mon, 16 Jun 2025 22:44:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xapps: fix e2sm-rc prb-quota control xapp

Rebuild the RRM Policy Ratio List so that the nested LIST/STRUCTURE RAN
parameters carry their ran_param_id, address the UE by gNB-DU UE ID, and
encode PLMN Identity, SST and SD as the octet strings E2SM-RC defines
instead of their decimal-string spellings.

